izbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":33,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ لَمۡ أَكُن لِّأَسۡجُدَ لِبَشَرٍ خَلَقۡتَهُۥ مِن صَلۡصَٰلٖ مِّنۡ حَمَإٖ مَّسۡنُونٖ","TajweedText":"قَالَ لَمْ أَك<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ُن ل</tajweed>ِّأَسْجُدَ لِبَشَرٍ خَلَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>قْ</tajweed>تَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ص</tajweed>َلْصَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>لٍ م</tajweed>ِّنْ حَمَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>إٍ م</tajweed>َّسْن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٣٣</span>","End":"٣٣","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":34,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"قَالَ فَٱخۡرُجۡ مِنۡهَا فَإِنَّكَ رَجِيمٞ","TajweedText":"قَالَ فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>خْرُ<tajweed class=qalaqah>جْ</tajweed> مِنْهَا فَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكَ رَج<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>مٌ <span class=end>٣٤</span>","End":"٣٤","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","VerseNumber":35,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَإِنَّ عَلَيۡكَ ٱللَّعۡنَةَ إِلَىٰ يَوۡمِ ٱلدِّينِ","TajweedText":"وَإِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َ عَلَيْكَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>لَّعْنَةَ إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>دّ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نِ <span class=end>٣٥</span>","End":"٣٥","PageNumber":264,"JuzNumber":14,"ManzilNumber":3,"RukuNumber":220,"MaqraNumber":105,"HizbNumber":27,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":15,"SurahIndex":"015","V